WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:05.466
Our heroes' journey to the Snowbelle City Gym continues

2
00:00:05.866 --> 00:00:10.233
and they now find themselves in a grassland of immense proportions.

3
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.800
We've been walking for so long.

4
00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:19.600
I'm totally exhausted.

5
00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:21.433
Oh, hang in there, Clemont.

6
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.033
Remember, we might come across some cool Pokémon.

7
00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:26.633
You two sure have a lot of energy.

8
00:00:27.233 --> 00:00:31.800
Clemont, you're gonna have to keep up or you'll get left behind.

9
00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.666
Hey, you've taunted me quite enough.

10
00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:41.400
That sound. What in the world was it?

11
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.166
A Pokémon?

12
00:00:47.366 --> 00:00:48.200
This way.

13
00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.733
It's a pride of Pyroar.

14
00:00:57.966 --> 00:00:59.400
They're so cute.

15
00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:31.800
I think they're having a fight.

16
00:01:31.866 --> 00:01:33.300
A fight? How come?

17
00:01:36.633 --> 00:01:38.600
Pyroar, the Royal Pokémon.

18
00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:42.833
Pyroar's mane, which is made of fire, becomes larger when it gets excited.

19
00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:52.433
Litleo, the Lion Cub Pokémon.

20
00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:55.366
Litleo must leave its pride and fend for itself

21
00:01:55.433 --> 00:01:56.766
in order to grow up strong.

22
00:01:58.666 --> 00:01:59.500
I see.

23
00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.200
So, Litleo's about to leave its pride.

24
00:02:02.266 --> 00:02:04.900
I think we're watching something quite profound.

25
00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:06.300
Amazing.

26
00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.066
Aw. It won't go.

27
00:02:17.433 --> 00:02:18.633
I wonder what's wrong?

28
00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:30.700
Oh, no, Litleo.

29
00:02:36.733 --> 00:02:37.566
Oh, no.

30
00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.933
- But, Ash, wait.
- Stop, Pyroar.

31
00:03:28.366 --> 00:03:30.000
You're being too rough, Pyroar.

32
00:03:30.066 --> 00:03:31.133
What's the big deal?

33
00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.633
Let it stay a little longer.

34
00:03:33.966 --> 00:03:35.800
Ash, just stay back.

35
00:03:35.866 --> 00:03:37.000
It's too dangerous.

36
00:03:37.066 --> 00:03:39.900
I can't just stand by and watch Litleo get hurt.

37
00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:45.600
All right, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt.

38
00:04:12.633 --> 00:04:13.600
They're all gone.

39
00:04:17.466 --> 00:04:19.033
Litleo, you okay?

40
00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:21.366
Pika. Pikachu.

41
00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.000
Hey, settle down.

42
00:04:27.566 --> 00:04:30.466
Litleo, we're your friends, not your enemies.

43
00:04:30.733 --> 00:04:32.933
Uh-oh! It's hurt.

44
00:04:33.666 --> 00:04:34.666
You're right.

45
00:04:35.433 --> 00:04:36.266
Clemont.

46
00:04:36.466 --> 00:04:38.300
Right. Let me treat that, okay?

47
00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:41.233
Litleo, please calm down.

48
00:04:41.933 --> 00:04:44.033
- Ah!
- Clemont, no.

49
00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:44.933
Are you okay?

50
00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:48.933
You're going to be fine now.

51
00:04:54.366 --> 00:04:56.166
I think Litleo's sorry.

52
00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.633
I think you're right.

53
00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:04.000
Hold on. I've got some Poké Puffs. Want one?

54
00:05:04.866 --> 00:05:05.700
Here.

55
00:05:14.233 --> 00:05:15.400
Wonder what's wrong.

56
00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:16.900
I know it's hungry.

57
00:05:17.133 --> 00:05:19.633
Maybe it's still in pain. Huh?

58
00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.766
- Wait. Litleo.
- Bonnie.

59
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.533
I think it's doing its best to try and learn how to be on its own.

60
00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.000
And Litleo's hurt.

61
00:05:29.133 --> 00:05:30.466
I'm worried, okay?

62
00:05:31.633 --> 00:05:34.933
I know. We could watch over Litleo from a distance.

63
00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.400
What do you think, Bonnie?

64
00:05:36.466 --> 00:05:39.066
Okay.

65
00:05:46.133 --> 00:05:47.300
Did you see that?

66
00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.766
What a scaredy-Pokémon.

67
00:05:49.833 --> 00:05:52.533
Yeah. But it evolves into a Pyroar.

68
00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.866
Correct. With strength that's awesome and fearsome.

69
00:05:56.033 --> 00:05:56.933
Really?

70
00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.033
That's my kind of combination.

71
00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:00.266
Then there you go.

72
00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.500
Team Rocket could use a rough-and-toughie.

73
00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:03.733
You see?

74
00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.133
So, let's grow our team by one.

75
00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.166
Think it'll be okay?

76
00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.766
What a treat. Fishing for Litleo is quite fun.

77
00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:54.766
Using berries for bait is great.

78
00:06:54.833 --> 00:06:56.200
Quit playing around.

79
00:06:56.266 --> 00:06:57.900
Catch it and make it snappy.

80
00:06:57.966 --> 00:06:58.833
Or faster.

81
00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:01.733
Okay, let it take a good chomp this time.

82
00:07:06.133 --> 00:07:08.033
Talk about procrastination.

83
00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.466
Hurry up and chow down on it already.

84
00:07:14.066 --> 00:07:18.066
Shh! This is getting good, so, will you be quiet. Aah!

85
00:07:18.133 --> 00:07:21.066
Hey, gang, don't look now. Company.

86
00:07:21.133 --> 00:07:22.400
You'll scare it away.

87
00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:23.733
Company?

88
00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.433
Relax.

89
00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.866
We're just doing a little canyon fishing.

90
00:07:30.933 --> 00:07:31.900
Jesse's right.

91
00:07:31.966 --> 00:07:35.333
We've reeled in the biggest catches you can imagine this way.

92
00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.533
Huh?

93
00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.933
Talk about a burning anger.

94
00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.466
I've been charbroiled.

95
00:08:28.433 --> 00:08:29.600
Aah!

96
00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:54.500
Litleo.

97
00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.066
Who's that Pokémon?

98
00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.033
It's Litleo.

99
00:10:23.533 --> 00:10:26.200
It's like a whole different Litleo than before.

100
00:10:26.266 --> 00:10:27.633
It's moving so fast.

101
00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:29.933
- Wonder what happened.
- Let's go.

102
00:10:39.166 --> 00:10:40.733
- Oh, no!
- Ash, help!

103
00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:43.133
Frogadier, use your Frubbles!

104
00:11:01.133 --> 00:11:03.366
- Ah!
- Thank goodness.

105
00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.933
But Fire-type Pokémon don't like water one bit.

106
00:11:19.233 --> 00:11:20.766
Will it be okay?

107
00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.566
- Aah!
- This looks bad.

108
00:11:33.633 --> 00:11:35.366
- Pika!
- Clemont.

109
00:11:35.433 --> 00:11:37.266
Quick, come on out, Chespin.

110
00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:41.100
Now pull those vines into the river.

111
00:11:50.066 --> 00:11:52.133
- Ha, ha! It worked.
- All right.

112
00:11:52.566 --> 00:11:54.966
We made it just in time. Thank you.

113
00:11:55.166 --> 00:11:57.000
You did a great job, Chespin.

114
00:11:58.833 --> 00:12:01.200
- Pika?
- Huh? Hey, look up there.

115
00:12:05.833 --> 00:12:06.666
Is that...?

116
00:12:07.433 --> 00:12:08.833
The Pyroar we saw?

117
00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:11.633
I wonder if it's been watching this the whole time.

118
00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:13.000
I'm sure that it has.

119
00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.300
The Pyroar.

120
00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:40.133
Of course.

121
00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:42.133
Litleo's been looking for food.

122
00:12:42.466 --> 00:12:43.733
It's being independent.

123
00:12:44.133 --> 00:12:46.333
That's why it's looking for food on its own.

124
00:12:46.466 --> 00:12:47.366
I see.

125
00:12:47.433 --> 00:12:50.000
So, that's why it wouldn't eat Serena's Poké Puff.

126
00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:53.533
Ah! Litleo was heading here to find berries

127
00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.333
so it could regain its strength.

128
00:13:17.933 --> 00:13:20.800
Do you think it knew that Pyroar was keeping an eye on it?

129
00:13:21.266 --> 00:13:22.600
Yes, I think it did.

130
00:13:22.733 --> 00:13:25.433
So, that's why Litleo was trying so hard.

131
00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.000
To reassure Pyroar.

132
00:13:27.066 --> 00:13:28.733
Litleo is amazing.

133
00:13:41.333 --> 00:13:44.066
You may have caught us with our guard down before,

134
00:13:44.133 --> 00:13:45.933
but this is a brand-new day.

135
00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.900
With our Vavoomonite Mark IV.

136
00:13:47.966 --> 00:13:49.666
An old design with new tricks.

137
00:13:58.466 --> 00:13:59.433
Now what?

138
00:14:03.533 --> 00:14:06.033
- Come in. We insist.
- Yeah.

139
00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:22.366
Hey, stop it.

140
00:14:22.433 --> 00:14:23.533
Let Pyroar go.

141
00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.733
Seriously?

142
00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:27.300
Prepare for trouble you'd think you would learn.

143
00:14:27.366 --> 00:14:29.733
Twerps don't appear to have brain cells to burn.

144
00:14:30.166 --> 00:14:32.233
To protect the world from devastation.

145
00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.833
To unite all people within our nation.

146
00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.600
To draw from the past, but never ever look back.

147
00:14:38.133 --> 00:14:40.733
With Pyroar in tow, what a punch we will pack.

148
00:14:41.533 --> 00:14:43.300
- Jesse.
- And James.

149
00:14:43.733 --> 00:14:46.733
Team Rocket blasts off with a new burst of muscle.

150
00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:49.766
Surrender now or get ready for one terrible tussle.

151
00:14:49.833 --> 00:14:51.166
Meowth, I hustle.

152
00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:55.800
Team Rocket.

153
00:14:55.866 --> 00:14:57.200
Not you again.

154
00:14:57.633 --> 00:14:59.900
Grab Pikachu, too. Right away.

155
00:14:59.966 --> 00:15:00.966
With a grin.

156
00:15:20.733 --> 00:15:22.566
Now Pikachu in.

157
00:15:22.633 --> 00:15:23.466
With a grin.

158
00:15:28.033 --> 00:15:30.233
Pikachu!

159
00:15:31.366 --> 00:15:32.900
Hang on, Pikachu!

160
00:15:33.866 --> 00:15:35.766
Pika-pika.

161
00:15:35.833 --> 00:15:37.833
Meowth, we need more oomph.

162
00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:40.366
Vavoomonite's going into hyper-drive.

163
00:15:50.666 --> 00:15:52.700
All right, who did that?

164
00:15:56.733 --> 00:15:57.800
It's Litleo.

165
00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.866
Stop acting like twerps.

166
00:16:15.033 --> 00:16:15.866
Litleo.

167
00:16:17.133 --> 00:16:18.600
Litleo, you okay?

168
00:16:32.533 --> 00:16:33.366
What was that?

169
00:16:33.433 --> 00:16:34.500
That was Overheat.

170
00:16:34.566 --> 00:16:37.433
Ha-ha-ha! Get ready for a treat.

171
00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:39.666
- All right, Vavoomonite Mark IV,
- All right, Vavoomonite Mark IV,

172
00:16:39.733 --> 00:16:41.033
- Mecha Evolve!
- Mecha Evolve!

173
00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:41.933
Problem solved.

174
00:16:51.366 --> 00:16:52.766
What a maroon.

175
00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:56.400
Mecha Overheat takes Pyroar's power and spits it back.

176
00:16:56.466 --> 00:16:57.300
Crispy, please.

177
00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:02.000
Pyroar, calm down!

178
00:17:02.066 --> 00:17:04.333
- Get back.
- It's too angry to think.

179
00:17:09.366 --> 00:17:11.733
Frogadier, use Water Pulse.

180
00:17:20.333 --> 00:17:21.166
No good.

181
00:17:21.233 --> 00:17:23.733
We've gotta calm down Pyroar somehow and quick.

182
00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:24.833
How can we do that?

183
00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:34.133
No. Litleo.

184
00:17:34.933 --> 00:17:35.833
Isn't that sweet?

185
00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.366
It loves having a hot time.

186
00:17:37.433 --> 00:17:38.733
And we do mean hot.

187
00:17:39.166 --> 00:17:40.333
Red-hot hot.

188
00:17:50.766 --> 00:17:51.633
Huh?

189
00:18:00.433 --> 00:18:02.833
How did that fuzzball get a backbone?

190
00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:08.400
But how?

191
00:18:08.533 --> 00:18:10.333
It just keeps moving ahead.

192
00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:11.366
I know why.

193
00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:13.400
It's trying to get to Pyroar.

194
00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:15.433
You can do it, Litleo.

195
00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.333
- Listen, Pyroar.
- Listen, please.

196
00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.833
Listen to Litleo's voice.

197
00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:30.333
Please.

198
00:18:48.033 --> 00:18:49.333
All right!

199
00:18:49.566 --> 00:18:51.966
Pyroar finally listened to Litleo.

200
00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.366
Oopsie-daisy.

201
00:18:53.433 --> 00:18:54.266
At least.

202
00:18:54.333 --> 00:18:55.566
I don't feel so good.

203
00:18:56.066 --> 00:18:58.900
Frogadier. Use Cut and slash open that cage.

204
00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:16.300
Now, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt and wrap it up.

205
00:19:24.866 --> 00:19:26.433
Some sun tan.

206
00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.033
And without a beach.

207
00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.433
I burn easily!

208
00:19:29.866 --> 00:19:32.266
We're blasting off again!

209
00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:39.100
Litleo.

210
00:19:39.166 --> 00:19:40.233
You okay?

211
00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:50.933
Wonderful.

212
00:19:51.333 --> 00:19:54.500
It looks like Litleo is able to take care of itself now.

213
00:19:54.833 --> 00:19:56.500
They're both so happy.

214
00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:07.400
Goodbye.

215
00:20:07.466 --> 00:20:08.833
Good luck, Litleo.

216
00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:10.266
Take good care.

217
00:20:10.333 --> 00:20:11.800
See you again.

218
00:20:12.133 --> 00:20:13.366
Pika!

219
00:20:17.266 --> 00:20:21.700
There's no doubt that Litleo is gonna become an awesome Pyroar someday.

220
00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:23.366
I'm glad.

221
00:20:28.633 --> 00:20:32.200
Like everyone, Litleo will encounter obstacles along the way.

222
00:20:32.433 --> 00:20:35.066
But now it will surely overcome them.

223
00:20:35.366 --> 00:20:39.500
After all, it has the strength and power to face troubles head on.

224
00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.666
And so, with Litleo's spirit in their hearts,

225
00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:47.400
our heroes are off once again as the journey continues.
